      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "(Video) Narrator: Eventually, these beasts are going to live in herds on the beaches.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8CF12196AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Theo Jansen is working hard on this evolution.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DF9D06AF30",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "Theo Jansen: I want to put these forms of life on the beaches.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BEE3D20268",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "And they should survive over there, on their own, in the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9318162D01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Learning to live on their own -- and it'll take couple of more years to let them walk on their own.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9900377430",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "Narrator: The mechanical beasts will not get their energy from food, but from the wind.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06EC1D13D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "The wind will move feathers on their back, which will drive their feet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26D917785A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "The beast walks sideways on the wet sand of the beach, with its nose pointed into the wind.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D15A529A6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "As soon as it walks into either the rolling surf or the dry sand, it stops, and walks in the opposite direction.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95E06041B5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Evolution has generated many species.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E2FBD56EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "(Music) This is the Animaris Currens Ventosa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7039744108",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "This is a herd, and it is built according to genetic codes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
