      "id": "B598045315",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "And this is the water feeler, and what's very important is this tube.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "662B253D92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "swallows water",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFAF7C527D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 57,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "feels the resistance of it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49BD6D7205",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "It sucks in air normally, but when it swallows water, it feels the resistance of it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E05A90DB0A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "So, imagine that the animal is walking towards the sea.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B826D1293B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "you should hear",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EDB69B533B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "As soon as it touches the water -- you should hear a sound of running air.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "001F3EDD3D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "(Sound of running air) Yes!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D68924A40",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "OK?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FAD5DD346E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "So if it doesn't feel, it will be drowned, OK?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9BACF5830",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Here we have the brain of the animal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "813C84D39B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "step counter",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA2CF4E695",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "it counts the steps",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C0A565674",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "In fact, it is a step counter, and it counts the steps.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9580B073B9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "It's a binary step counter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5A096FE736",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "So as soon it has been to the sea, it changes the pattern of zeroes and ones here.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83FBEE52EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "And it always knows where it is on the beach.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "110D382002",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "So it's very simple brain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7CA1CDD4FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "It says, well, there's the sea, there are dunes, and I'm here.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0621671B2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "sort of imagination",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61622259AD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "So it's a sort of imagination of the simple world of the beach animal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3810DED396",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34131AADC6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "One of the biggest enemies are the storms.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1222F5924D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "This is a part of the nose of the Animaris Percipiere.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7687FAA1F7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "When the nose of the animal is fixed, the whole animal is fixed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11670FEB72",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "So when the storm is coming up, it drives a pin into the ground.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFE7D67111",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "(Laughter) Audience member: Wow!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57A1C47937",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "The nose is fixed, the whole animal is fixed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "142CD77F82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "The wind may turn, but the animal will always turn its nose into the wind.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26930E52BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Now, another couple of years, and these animals will survive on their own.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B35BA13307",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "I still have to help them a lot.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "819585BC4A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Thank you very much, ladies and gentlemen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D95E07AE16",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "927CEBB1CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}